        {
          "id": "1495932973375",
          "elementType": "SECTION",
          "config": {
            "alignment": "LEFT",
            "description": "",
            "formElements": [
              {
                "config": {
                  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24pt;\"><strong>Possible matches found</strong></span></p><p>We searched ISC using fuzzy first and last name (<code>~2</code>) and exact work email. The list below shows display name and email only - ISC forms cannot show full identity attributes here.</p><p>Select a row and use <strong>Open selected identity in ISC</strong> to review accounts, manager, and lifecycle before deciding.</p>",
                  "label": "Introduction",
                  "showLabel": false
                },
                "elementType": "DESCRIPTION",
                "id": "3847291056381",
                "key": "",
                "validations": []
              },
              {
                "config": {
                  "dataSource": {
                    "config": {
                      "formInputId": "identities",
                      "sortBy": "ASC"
                    },
                    "dataSourceType": "FORM_INPUT"
                  },
                  "forceSelect": true,
                  "helpText": "Choose the identity that matches this person, or mark them as a new hire below.",
                  "label": "Existing identity",
                  "maximum": 1,
                  "placeholder": "Select a matching identity...",
                  "required": false
                },
                "elementType": "SELECT",
                "id": "469892241994",
                "key": "identities",
                "validations": [
                  {
                    "validationType": "DATA_SOURCE"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "config": {
                  "description": "<p><a href=\"{{$.form.input.iscUiUrl}}/ui/a/admin/identities/{{$.form.data.identities}}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open selected identity in ISC</a></p><p><em>The link uses the selected identity id. If it does not refresh when you change the dropdown, re-select the person after the list loads.</em></p>",
                  "label": "Identity link",
                  "showLabel": false
                },
                "elementType": "DESCRIPTION",
                "id": "5821938472610",
                "key": "",
                "validations": []
              },
              {
                "config": {
                  "default": false,
                  "falseLabel": "No",
                  "helpText": "Turn on to ignore the list and create a new account for a different person.",
                  "label": "This is a new person",
                  "trueLabel": "Yes"
                },
                "elementType": "TOGGLE",
                "id": "131771748080",
                "key": "newIdentity",
                "validations": []
              }
            ],
            "label": "Possible matches",
            "labelStyle": "h2",
            "showLabel": true
          },
          "validations": []
        }
      ],
      "formConditions": [
